    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Naas welcome you to 23 The Way - a well presented semi detached residence boasting a large corner garden to the rear. This fine home enjoys light filled interiors and offers scope for an extension to the side or rear subject to the necessary planning permission. The property is nicely positioned on a quiet cul de sac.\r\n\r\nCraddockstown Park is only a short walk from the main street of Naas town centre. Naas General Hospital is just around the corner. All amenities including shops, shopping centres, schools (both primary and secondary), parks, playgrounds, pubs and restaurants are near by. The Kerry Global Plant is within a ten minute drive. The N7 will take you to the M50 with ease. The Arrow train service is available from Sallins. Relaxing walks can be enjoyed on the pathways adjacent to the nearby lakes.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 102 square meters comprising entrance hallway, lounge, dining area, kitchen, three bedrooms (main en-suite), bathroom and guest wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.94m x 4.42m (6' 4\" x 14' 6\")\r\nDecorative coving. Smoke alarm. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n1.85m x 1.46m (6' 1\" x 4' 9\")\r\nWith wc and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.64m x 4.65m (11' 11\" x 15' 3\")\r\nLaminate flooring. Feature fireplace with cast-iron tiled inset. Decorative coving. Wall lights. Double doors with glazed insets leading to Dining Area.\r\n\r\nDining Area\r\n3.88m x 5.68m (12' 9\" x 18' 8\")\r\nTiled floor. Decorative coving. Recess lighting. Sliding patio doors to rear. Archway to:\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.96m x 2.27m (9' 9\" x 7' 5\")\r\nWall and base fitted units. Display unit. Large area of tiled worktop space with stainless steel sink unit. Tiled splashback. Electric cooker. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Island with worktop space, extra storage units and wine rack. Tiled floor. Door to garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n1.91m x 3.31m (6' 3\" x 10' 10\")\r\nHotpress. Smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.93m x 3.73m (9' 7\" x 12' 3\")\r\nTo rear. Double fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.87m x 2.78m (2' 10\" x 9' 1\")\r\nWhite wc and wash hand basin. Tiled Triton shower with screen. Shaver light. Fitted shelving. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.97m x 4.00m (9' 9\" x 13' 1\")\r\nTo front. Fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.59m x 2.42m (8' 6\" x 7' 11\")\r\nTo front. Fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.41m x 1.80m (7' 11\" x 5' 11\")\r\nWhite wc, wash hand basin and bath with telephone shower.. Generous wall tiles. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nFront: Well maintained lawn. Driveway with space for two cars. Outside light. Side access to rear.\r\nRear: Large corner garden (14 meters x 17 meters) offering potential for extension (subject to planning permission). Well maintained lawn. Outside tap. Outside light."
      },
